# Skinwise marketing site — environment variables
#
# Sub-project A (this app: the static/SSG marketing site) requires NO
# environment variables to install, run, build, or test. Every page is
# static content sourced from config/ and content/ — there is no database,
# no auth, and no third-party API call anywhere in this build.
#
# The variables below are NOT used yet. They are documented here so the
# shape is known in advance, but they belong to Sub-projects B (quiz engine
# + lead storage + admin panel, Supabase-backed) and C (payments/checkout,
# if ever added) per PROJECT_BLUEPRINT.md. Do NOT uncomment or invent real
# values for any of these — per the blueprint's execution rules (§23 rule
# 12), credentials are never fabricated; they must come from the client.

# --- Sub-project B: Supabase (quiz leads, contact submissions, admin auth) ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- Sub-project B: transactional email (new-lead notifications) ---
# RESEND_API_KEY=

# --- Sub-project C: payments (if/when checkout is added) ---
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER_PUBLIC_KEY=
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER_SECRET_KEY=

# --- Stage 2: Skin Check persistence ---------------------------------
# Until these are set, POST /api/v1/assessments/submit returns
# { status: "fallback" } and the UI hands the user to WhatsApp rather than
# showing a success screen for a lead nobody received. See
# lib/assessment/storage.ts. Placeholders only — never commit real values.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=        # safe for the browser
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=   # safe for the browser
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=       # SERVER ONLY. Never prefix NEXT_PUBLIC_.

# --- Stage 3.2: internal expert/admin workspace ----------------------
# Shared secret exchanged for a signed httpOnly session cookie by
# /api/v1/admin/login; middleware.ts gates every /admin route with it.
# Interim single-team-token auth, to be replaced by per-expert Supabase
# Auth. Placeholder only — never commit a real value.
# ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# --- Stage 4: AI text assistant --------------------------------------
# Anthropic Messages API key (server-only). Without it, /api/v1/assistant
# degrades to a WhatsApp handoff rather than failing. Recommended model is
# claude-haiku-4-5 for a grounded product-Q&A assistant. Placeholder only.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
